{
	"name": "Display language with client language",
	"description": "Shows the display language's text with the client language's added: names as \"display (client)\", descriptions and dialogue with the client language on the next line.",
	"_comment": [
		"Shows the display language with the client language added: names as \"display (client)\", descriptions and dialogue as the display language's text with the client language's on the next line. Every other text is in the display language, as without this file.",
		"\"Display language\" is the language chosen in Modding → Languages → Display language, whose text is merged in from the other regional client; \"client language\" is the game client's own language. Steps see the display language's text before \\u001F (\"merged\") and the client language's after it (\"client\").",
		"Works for any pair of languages. Names go on one line on both sides; in descriptions and dialogue, the text shown first keeps its line breaks and the added text goes on one line. A line break (and spaces around it) is removed where the characters on both sides of it, skipping other macros, are Chinese or Japanese (Han, kana, CJK punctuation, fullwidth forms, ‥…―—), and becomes one space otherwise; Hangul doesn't count, as Korean puts spaces between words.",
		"Spaces and line breaks around each text are trimmed first. When both texts are the same, or one is empty, it is shown once, keeping its line breaks in descriptions and dialogue. Afterwards, repeated spaces are collapsed and the result is trimmed.",
		"Quest phrases typed in /say stay in the client language by themselves.",
		"Converted from the old ExcelTransformConfig presets (EnglishWithKorean, KoreanWithEnglish, JapaneseWithEnglish, ...), which listed the same sheets and columns for every language pair."
	],
	"^(?:Achievement|Action|AOZScore|ChocoboRaceAbility|ChocoboRaceChallenge|ChocoboRaceItem|Companion|CompanyAction|CompanyCraftDraft|CompleteJournal|ContentGauge|ContentUiCategory|CraftAction|DawnMemberUiParam|DeepDungeonFloorEffectUi|DpsChallenge|DynamicEvent|DynamicEventEnemyType|Emote|ExtraCommand|ExVersion|FashionCheckThemeCategory|FashionCheckWeeklyTheme|Fate|GatheringSubcategory|GCArmyExpedition|GCArmyTraining|GoldSaucerArcadeMachine|GrandCompany|GuardianDeity|ItemSearchCategory|ItemSeries|ItemUiCategory|JournalCategory|JournalGenre|JournalSection|LegacyQuest|Leve|LeveClient|ManeuversArmor|Marker|MinionRace|MinionRules|MinionSkillType|MinionStage|MycWarResultNotebook|OpenContentCandidateName|Orchestrion|OrchestrionCategory|PartyContentTextData|Pet|PetAction|PetMirage|Quest|QuestRedoChapterUiCategory|QuestRedoChapterUiTab|SkyIsland2Mission|Snipe|SnipeTalkName|Status|SubmarineExploration|Town|TripleTriadCard|TripleTriadRule)$": {
